Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚马逊盆地的食人巨蟒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说被土人供成神来祭拜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨蟒长达四十尺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶残至极
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨蟒不满于只是吞噬猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,犹吐出未死的猎物 再杀一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.99,0:01:09.26,Title,0,0,0,0,,《狂蟒之灾》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.08,0:02:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救！救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, help. Somebody, help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急呼叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an emergency Somebody, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.59,0:04:41.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（亚马逊丛林旅馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,芙勒薇小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Flores.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.06,0:05:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Cale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进 何时到的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in. When did you get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天前 我问过向导{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple days ago. I've been talking to some guides…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部族的下落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hoping they might know the whereabouts of our tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有这个部落存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's evidence to suspect that these people are out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,能找到并研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and can be found and studied.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么告诉赞助者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least that's what I told the grant people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,向导说大概在这附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man thinks the tribe was here, between these two tributaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾见过标记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found one of their markers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.09,0:05:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许真能找到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去 我拍下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me there and I'll shoot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 所以雇用你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm counting on that. That's why I hired you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 非常感激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you did. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:05:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是很好的导演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted the best director I could get.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:05:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会是好伙伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we'll make a good team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好狼狈 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a mess. What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,被食人鱼攻击 差点没命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a small attack of piranha. Barely escaped with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.19,0:06:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,带另一桶油来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the other fuel drums.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你起得真早啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's up awfully early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.97,0:06:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是好日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, today is a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.15,0:06:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.61,0:06:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我的老乡今天要当导演了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not every day my homegirl from 'SC gets to direct her own documentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恭喜 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Congratulations. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,何况还有他作伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you made this a pleasure cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.49,0:06:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该了解我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作时不谈感情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mix business with pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是经由这里呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about if we go up through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.43,0:07:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,往这里走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,比较好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则后果自行负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, I cannot be responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.01,0:07:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 只多走55公里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's only 55 kilometers out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.21,0:07:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 安全第一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't be a problem. Better safe than sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 - 早安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰 你懂我说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo, you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听得懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 把船开过去 我要拍摄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. I need you to drift through that channel. I want some shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,全听你的 大姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you say… cheffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.89,0:07:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请过目 - 谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For your approval. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯屈呢？他应该到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Westridge? I know he checked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许在睡美容觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably catching up on his beauty sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是葡萄酒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bordeaux!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,易碎品！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fragile!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很贵的酒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expensive wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.57,0:07:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.91,0:07:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 旅途如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning. How was your flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实糟透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bloody nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ongoing, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个变焦镜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One zoom lens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！拿到我房里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. Stow these in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:08:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是小妹 我是制片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the bellhop. I'm the production manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,搬行李就更没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then manage my things into my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.43,0:08:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,自大的混球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One pompous ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些文化 瞧得起你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In some cultures it's a sign of friendship and respect…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.94,0:08:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,才叫你提{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if someone asks you to carry their bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,音效师 瞧这个吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respect this, sound man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯屈 我是戴芮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Westridge… Terri Flores.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.01,0:08:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔给我看过你作品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Cale lent me some of your short films.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想它们…很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they were… very promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.95,0:08:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么热！我们在赤道上？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, it's hot. Are we exactly on the equator?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎登船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.95,0:08:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他喜欢你 - 你感觉到了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think he likes you. - Oh, you felt that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 凯尔 你看起来就像法国制片家贾古斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, Cale, you look like a low budget-ass Jacques Cousteau.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the hell that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫！往内格罗河出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheffe! Ready for Rio Negro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家再次检查装备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, double check your gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定大家都在船上 别忘了带防虫液{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure it's on board. And pray you didn't forget your bug spray.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.83,0:09:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的探险由亚马逊河口出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our adventure begins 1, 000 miles from the mouth of the mighty A mazon…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,深入雨林区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}deep in the heart of the rain forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.57,0:09:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里 我们将要进入未开发的蛮荒雨林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From here, we will travel up shallow tributaries and unexplored backwaters…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,探索传说中的谜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in search of the elusive People of the Mist…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚夏麻族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Shirishama Tribe…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,揭开雨林的神秘面纱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of the last great mysteries of the rain forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我还是丛林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it just me or does the jungle make you really…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,令你如此性感？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}really horny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是丛林的气氛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think it's the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我只想做一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious. I've got one thing on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.99,0:10:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我工作 行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I work, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.73,0:10:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被困住了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stranded!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.31,0:10:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的船搁浅了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boat is stranded in the roots!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那船上有个人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a dude on the boat over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.59,0:10:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,开向那艘船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over to his boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接你过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll bring you on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank the Lord for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.67,0:11:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢主！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank the Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.95,0:11:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,船的推进器被撞坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My propeller tore off in the roots!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能载你回去 我们往上游{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't take you back to Manaus. We're headed upriver.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个村落的人会帮我修船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the next village, I know the people. They help me fix my boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.93,0:11:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉给你们添麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sorry if I be trouble for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用道歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我们的船没坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all at the mercy of our machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:12:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,原始捕鱼方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish, river-style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次要拍下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to have to get that on film next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,会做生鱼片 你叫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever work in a sushi bar, Mr?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨朗 保罗萨朗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarone. Paul Sarone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.05,0:12:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拉圭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paraguay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.35,0:12:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来想当祭司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started out studying for the priesthood…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.69,0:12:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.19,0:12:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,想见识真实世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to see the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就待在丛林里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I ended up in the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我适合这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,做不成祭司能做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does a failed priest do in the jungle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.87,0:12:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,做不成？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我做不成？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says I fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.71,0:12:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不做而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现时靠何维生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what is your… calling now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.31,0:12:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.48,0:12:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I catch them…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为动物园或收藏家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for zoos and collectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都抓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗猎？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poaching?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗猎是非法的 请问你们猎些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poaching is illegal. May I ask, what you are hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么都不捕猎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not hunting or trapping anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拍制纪录片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're making a documentary on the…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于西夏麻族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shirishama Indians.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中的谜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The People of the Mist?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你听过？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. You've heard of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.01,0:13:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我们在哪里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you show me where that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.75,0:13:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们救了我的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以带你们去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can show you exactly where I saw the Shirishama.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听喝了五杯威士忌的醉鬼胡说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So slurs every other river rat after five whiskeys in any bar in Manaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.26,0:13:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,五杯威士忌？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five whiskeys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是早餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's breakfast on the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙拉配着鱼吃对味吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, would a salad go well with "fish, river-style, " Mr. Sarone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙拉很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A salad would be perfect…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小丫头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}little baby bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是荧火虫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those? Fireflies?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞘翅目类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family Lampyridae.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.18,0:14:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚集在一棵树上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On certain nights they all gather in the same tree and…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,用亮光向异性示爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}use their white flashes to announce their readiness to mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,公的还是母的发亮？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who flashes? The males or the females?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.06,0:14:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会发亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,母的发光较短促{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The females with a series of short, dainty…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次持续约八秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}feminine little flashes, about eight per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,公的以持续的发光热烈反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The males respond with a series of long, drawn out, manly flashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.74,0:15:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.51,0:15:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用说废话 不会有误解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pick up lines, no misunderstandings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然的本性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just instinct and nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.43,0:16:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵死人了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody racket!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我音响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch my radio!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心我雇人宰了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could cheerfully hire someone to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.55,0:16:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个土人 五十元就够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A local tribesman, perhaps. Fifty dollars should cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能免费杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I could kill you for free right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就凭你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.59,0:16:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和谁呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and whose army?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.53,0:16:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mama's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,接近了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we getting close?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just around this bend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.23,0:17:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇的图腾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A snake totem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.83,0:17:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这图腾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This totem…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是西夏麻族的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Shirishama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.63,0:17:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们祭拜巨蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shirishama worship giant snakes…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,视为守护神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}anacondas, as gods and protectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说有个神秘之湖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a legend they pass down of a journey to a sacred lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过有巨蟒看守的瀑布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pass a waterfall protected by warrior snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.25,0:17:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你通过那些守护神 就到达西夏麻族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you pass those guardians…you travel through the land of the Shirishama…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.02,0:18:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到看到一座墙 墙很高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you come to a wall so high it blots out the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,再往前走五日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow that wall for five days…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可达尽头：西夏麻族的圣地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}finally reaching its end:the head of a giant anaconda.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说过？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.10,0:18:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美的传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是麻库族的传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe, however, it's a legend of the Maku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是西夏麻族的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also the Shirishama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to my knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.28,0:18:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,涨潮了 村子就在附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water's high now, but the village was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.55,0:18:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入支流就看得到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down this fork.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以捕蛇为生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trap snakes for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你很在行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure you're very good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.06,0:18:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我对找部落很在行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I locate tribes for a living, and I'm very good at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据我的经验 河水暴涨表示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water level is high, which by my calculations means…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近常淹水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the areas to this side will be flooded…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫使土族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}forcing our tribe, if they wanted to eat…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,往高处迁移{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to seek higher ground over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要往哪走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.64,0:18:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,往这儿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯屈 来跟图腾一起拍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Westridge, I want a shot of you with the totem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞 你来录音 丹尼 准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary, you roll sound. Danny, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,开机了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camera rolling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍摄！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.09,0:19:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our first piece of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.90,0:19:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了一座西夏麻神像 虽有一些争议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Shirishama idol, although the subject of some dispute…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不信算了！下个村就让我下船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accept it or not. Leave me at the next village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.73,0:19:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很乐意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.36,0:19:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去录虫鸣声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to go get some wild sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.63,0:19:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不可思议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.05,0:20:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.69,0:20:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好安静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The silence?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.36,0:21:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞 快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Gary!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.35,0:21:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰 用光照那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo, shine the light over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.47,0:22:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能活着真命大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These two are fortunate to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.18,0:22:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.64,0:22:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是盖的 好厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've seen it. What a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一枪就把它击毙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy blasted this thing coming right at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.39,0:22:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,野猪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wild boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.79,0:22:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用獠牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gores with its tusks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,又狠又准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes for the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.86,0:22:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.43,0:22:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.93,0:22:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.93,0:22:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 以后晚上都留在船上 没有例外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, everybody stays on board at night. No exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.44,0:22:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a smart idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.11,0:22:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰 把它宰杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's cut him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.34,0:22:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,够吃一星期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.31,0:22:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.37,0:23:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该我？- 不 该我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My turn? - It's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.04,0:23:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it isn't. - Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.22,0:23:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰 你会驾船？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo, do you have control of this vessel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.59,0:23:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会别逞强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie if you must!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.90,0:23:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.73,0:23:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳子缠住推进器了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn rope's caught in the propeller!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.08,0:23:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我去割断绳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like I'll have to cut us loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.88,0:24:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去会好点 河水有上千种方法可以杀死你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's maybe better I do it. This river can kill you in a thousand ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.30,0:24:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.42,0:24:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只怕线鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only really afraid of the candiru acu.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.66,0:24:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.16,0:24:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,线鱼 很小的鲶鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candiru acu. It's a tiny little catfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.60,0:24:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会游入尿道中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It swims up into your urethra…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.40,0:24:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个温暖之处 展开尖鳍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}finds a nice warm spot, spreads its thorny little spines…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.27,0:24:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖着不走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and refuses to budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.10,0:24:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.04,0:24:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须动手术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.11,0:24:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了！我要回洛杉矶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, man. I'm getting the hell back to L.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.08,0:25:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴芮 不对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terri, something's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.52,0:25:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.75,0:25:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cale?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.02,0:25:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受伤了！我去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hurt. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.36,0:25:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急 我去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up. I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.59,0:25:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.70,0:25:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.70,0:25:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,游快一点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.50,0:25:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,史堤夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steven!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.70,0:26:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有呼吸吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.37,0:26:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.07,0:26:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.38,0:26:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.18,0:26:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.75,0:26:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.02,0:26:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,氧气罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get his mask off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.52,0:26:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.79,0:26:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的头垫高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get something for his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.72,0:26:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没呼吸了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.63,0:26:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没呼吸了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.09,0:26:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把头垫高 - 来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something for his head. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.89,0:26:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他嘴里有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something in the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.73,0:26:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.33,0:26:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.07,0:26:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.87,0:26:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,致命的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.41,0:26:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.58,0:26:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没呼吸了 怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still not breathing. What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.65,0:26:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 怎么会这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, how did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.92,0:26:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒精{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.82,0:26:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有威士忌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got whiskey in my flask.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.13,0:26:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.26,0:27:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.37,0:27:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他呼吸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.94,0:27:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.61,0:27:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还好 我们出发！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems okay. We should go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.64,0:27:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,无线电失灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That radio don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.14,0:27:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯中断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.64,0:27:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会修 行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I can't fix, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.21,0:27:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can start now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.28,0:27:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不有雾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.68,0:27:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快送他去医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't get this man to a hospital soon…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.65,0:27:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了只有扔入河里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might as well throw him in the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.35,0:27:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.65,0:27:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴芮 我们有照明设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terri, we got lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.52,0:28:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.16,0:28:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.46,0:28:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尽快回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just double back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.66,0:28:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,逆流而上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting the current…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.67,0:28:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,多两天行程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iose two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.17,0:28:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,由支流回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut back to this tributary…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.67,0:28:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,省五十英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}save us 50 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.65,0:28:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你昨天建议的路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the route you suggested we take yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.68,0:28:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天有不同的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, for a different reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.75,0:28:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是为了送他去医院 可能的话越快越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, our concern is getting Professor Cale to a hospital…as fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.35,0:28:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.42,0:28:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要想清楚再决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.69,0:28:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about this dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.46,0:28:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What choice do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.60,0:29:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.97,0:29:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴芮 过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terri, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.84,0:29:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你说的河道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the river you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.28,0:29:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.04,0:29:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,栅栏是新建的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.45,0:29:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是别惊慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no cause for panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.79,0:29:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有惊慌 我只是看到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not panicking. I just see this wall…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.29,0:30:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的河道被堵住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}blocking our way down this river that you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.89,0:30:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们想想办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's just see what we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.33,0:30:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是炸药？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real dynamite?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.13,0:30:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always good to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.03,0:30:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么万一？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepared for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开玩笑 那栅栏在那里一定有它的目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be kidding. That thing must be there for a reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.81,0:30:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让我们进入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, to keep us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.38,0:30:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有可能会影响河川生态平衡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't upset the ecological balance of this river.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.81,0:30:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.11,0:30:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分钟就可炸掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can blow it in ten minutes, or if…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.48,0:30:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则就多两天行程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're feeling sensitive, we can turn around and lose two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.68,0:30:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,取决于你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.13,0:30:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴芮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terri.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.33,0:30:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！炸了那东西吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, blow the bloody thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.17,0:30:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我十分钟 朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me ten minutes, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.50,0:30:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需十分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.84,0:30:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.01,0:30:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞 把船拉来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary? Get that little boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.89,0:31:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西在下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.49,0:31:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.03,0:31:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我说真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I really mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really mean it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.40,0:31:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.31,0:32:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！天！到处都是蛇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Goddamn! Snakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.71,0:32:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 真恶心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God! - Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.95,0:32:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.28,0:32:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是小蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.72,0:32:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么把它们弄走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get them off the boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.95,0:32:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝们 来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.79,0:32:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去找妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to your mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.29,0:32:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些不是小蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some aren't babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.83,0:32:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.00,0:32:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.80,0:32:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨朗 帮他弄掉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarone, help him get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.04,0:33:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人把这个东西弄走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone get this bloody thing off my frigging hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.81,0:33:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.75,0:33:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么小就这么凶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So young and yet so lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.48,0:33:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快弄走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.48,0:33:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.49,0:33:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.49,0:33:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有蛇 对不对 萨朗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew there were snakes here, didn't you, Sarone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.10,0:33:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个意外的惊喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.33,0:33:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃油怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the fuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.83,0:33:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩一桶 只够走一百公里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one drum left. Enough for 100 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.07,0:33:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,约一天行程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a day's ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.84,0:33:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,该足够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.01,0:33:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,去去找妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.79,0:33:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.33,0:33:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸正常了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's breathing normally now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.60,0:34:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.60,0:34:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会平安回去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.27,0:34:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.04,0:34:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨朗应该带我们去医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarone's supposed to get us back to the hospital, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.55,0:34:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像很了解这河道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he acts like he owns this river…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.05,0:34:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他却带我们闯进栅栏里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we run into a barrier…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.05,0:34:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.56,0:34:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想带我们去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, where is he taking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.72,0:34:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.69,0:34:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,停船！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.43,0:35:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.46,0:35:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么停船？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we stopping now?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.10,0:35:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里会有燃油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.94,0:35:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过那艘船？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.11,0:35:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多船都长那样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's lots of boats like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.38,0:35:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.72,0:35:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定没人在船上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the distinct impression there's nobody home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.76,0:35:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰 跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.87,0:35:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.70,0:35:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拍下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get this on film.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.97,0:35:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要配音吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need sound, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.47,0:35:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.31,0:37:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去船尾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go aft.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.75,0:37:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨朗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarone?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.93,0:37:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里阴森森的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of spooky in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.93,0:37:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.61,0:38:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.82,0:38:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我搬这个 - 那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me with this. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.65,0:38:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝藏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.96,0:38:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.90,0:39:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心！我的摄影机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful. I put my camera in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.02,0:39:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰 好 走了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo, that's it! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.69,0:39:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.36,0:39:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.89,0:40:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.93,0:40:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 燃油呢？- 没有燃油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the fuel? - There was no fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.40,0:40:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Mateo?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.13,0:40:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.47,0:40:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.04,0:40:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回去找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.08,0:40:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨朗 陪他去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarone, go with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.68,0:40:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许改天吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.52,0:40:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑球！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.43,0:40:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们停留在这个鬼地方而驾驶却不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuck in the middle of nowhere and we've lost the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.27,0:40:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.11,0:40:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 出来 别闹了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Stop playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.10,0:41:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.58,0:41:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.38,0:41:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.15,0:41:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.49,0:41:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.99,0:41:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.99,0:41:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.16,0:41:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,多令人放心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.66,0:41:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.99,0:41:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.10,0:41:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只找到这个 - 只有这个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is it. - This is all you found?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.83,0:41:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.76,0:41:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.01,0:41:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨蟒脱的皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anaconda skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.11,0:41:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇有这么大？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's snakes out there this big?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.01,0:41:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是三 四岁的蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This skin is three or four years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.01,0:42:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在一定更大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever shed it has grown since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.38,0:42:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只巨蟒吃了我们的驾驶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like this has made a meal of our dear captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.29,0:42:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.79,0:42:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇不吃人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snakes don't eat people.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.79,0:42:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.19,0:42:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨蟒是完美的杀人机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anacondas are a perfect killing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.33,0:42:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们有热感应器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have heat sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.37,0:42:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰的体温在水中很容易侦测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A warm body like Mateo's in the water wasn't hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.70,0:42:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们攻击你 缠住你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They strike, wrap around you…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.27,0:42:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,比爱人抱得还紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hold you tighter than your true love…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.91,0:42:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在死前将你听到自己骨头碎裂声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you get the privilege of hearing your bones break…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.81,0:42:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,血管被压挤得根根爆裂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the power of the embrace causes your veins to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.72,0:42:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰可能迷路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mateo's probably just lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.22,0:42:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做梦了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.22,0:42:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,若能活捉到这只巨蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine something this big captured alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.23,0:42:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,将非常值钱 盖瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worth a lot of money, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.26,0:42:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.73,0:42:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, people…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.17,0:42:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把我当怪物看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't make me out a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.07,0:43:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我吃了马泰的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't eat the captain Mateo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.07,0:43:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 打起精神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.58,0:43:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不确定马泰已死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not sure Mateo is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.35,0:43:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等到明天早上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to wait here till morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.11,0:43:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.68,0:43:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为他会去哪里？难道他去丛林散步了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think he went? A walk in the woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.85,0:43:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们必须赶快离开这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. We've got to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.92,0:43:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冷静点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.19,0:43:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很冷静！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.59,0:43:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不走 换做你 也会希望我们等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was you out there, you'd want us to stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.76,0:43:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,换做是我早就死了 你不明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was me out there, I'd be dead! Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.10,0:43:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回房里 锁上门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go into your cabin and lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.94,0:43:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,像被禁足{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a bad boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.94,0:43:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.11,0:43:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的鞋呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.80,0:43:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,将灯打在那船上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna aim some lights at the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.28,0:43:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.48,0:43:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光是好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights are a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.31,0:44:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定是他吃了马泰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure he didn't eat the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.51,0:44:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来很满足的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sure looks satiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.82,0:44:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜他还活着吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think he's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.32,0:44:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 去睡吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Let's go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.93,0:44:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.23,0:44:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,又很刺激 对吗 盖瑞？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger is exciting. Huh, Gary?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.67,0:44:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先去睡 我就来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on to bed. I'll catch up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.77,0:44:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.51,0:44:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他说句话就来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going to talk for a second and then catch up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.01,0:44:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我好怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up. I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.88,0:44:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.48,0:44:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…巨蟒在附近？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's out there, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.29,0:44:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.96,0:45:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道如何捕捉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know how to catch these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.03,0:45:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.26,0:45:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一个人无法捉巨蟒 需要伙伴帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't catch an anaconda by yourself. You need a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.30,0:45:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,活捉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capture alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.54,0:45:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许值上百万 盖瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe a million dollars, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.99,0:45:29.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爬虫类镇静剂）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.08,0:45:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没马泰的影子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still no Mateo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.92,0:46:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯屈 保持平稳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it steady, Westridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.99,0:46:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳着点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.07,0:46:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.37,0:46:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓巨蟒不能没有饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't catch anacondas without bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.04,0:47:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.05,0:47:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯屈 走吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Westridge, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.81,0:47:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！等等！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.22,0:47:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能用我的船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on my boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.72,0:47:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的船？你代表大家？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boat? You speak for everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.19,0:47:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garry?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.09,0:47:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她代表大家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She speak for everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.93,0:47:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garry?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.20,0:47:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为凯尔受伤 电影也拍不成了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I figure it, with Cale messed up the movie's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.04,0:47:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得另谋他途{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not salvage something?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.70,0:47:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拍萨朗抓蛇的镜头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's film Sarone capturing a big snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.94,0:47:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.71,0:47:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我疯了？不 我清醒得很{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I haven't! If anything, I'm completely lucid now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.78,0:47:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们才应该睁大眼睛想清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's you guys who need to open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.05,0:47:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.79,0:47:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要送凯尔去医院 怎么能抓蛇？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we go from taking Cale to the hospital to catching a goddamn snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.75,0:47:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你们身在何处？你们在丛林中当中！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where you are? You're in the middle of the jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.89,0:47:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不断怀疑 抱怨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you guys do is question and criticize.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.23,0:47:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是请记住 你们对这地方屁都不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But remember, you don't know shit about the shit we're in out here…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.40,0:48:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and neither do I, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.67,0:48:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道谁懂 就是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I guarantee you I know who does. This guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.87,0:48:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗来过这里 如果帮他捕蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul has been here, and if we help him catch the snake…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.07,0:48:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会带我们平安回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll help us get out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.38,0:48:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这不是发疯 那是极为合理的判断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, amigos, is not insanity. That is common freaking sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.71,0:48:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞 别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Gary…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.28,0:48:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this isn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.95,0:48:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他把你怎么了？- 够了！别说了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did he do to you? - Stop, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.45,0:48:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看这样值多少钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about how much money this would be worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.89,0:48:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,将前所未见的巨蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine capturing something like this on film…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.03,0:48:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍入镜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the first time ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.93,0:48:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,何况 我们别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, what else are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.23,0:48:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.14,0:48:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们丢进河里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll throw both y'all son of a bitches in the river myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.48,0:48:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.24,0:48:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望发生这种事 朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want this to happen, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.25,0:48:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出发吧！卫斯屈！- 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go, Westridge! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.69,0:48:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.45,0:48:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找点事做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occupy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.89,0:49:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩玩牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play some cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.91,0:50:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,都别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody move.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.29,0:51:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞 开灯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garry! Get the lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.82,0:51:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯屈 停船！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Westridge, stop the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.89,0:51:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.23,0:51:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 美人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buenas noches, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.40,0:51:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯屈 下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down here, Westridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.90,0:51:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会害我们送命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get us all killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.97,0:51:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！照着它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.04,0:51:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,照眼睛！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for the eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.07,0:51:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它看不见！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blind it!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.54,0:51:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你在钓蛇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ. You're fishing for a snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.58,0:51:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man gotta be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.15,0:51:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.41,0:51:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯屈 下来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Westridge, come down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.58,0:52:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨蟒呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.88,0:52:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨蟒呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.50,0:52:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！我用麻醉枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move! I'll get it with a tranquilizer!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.09,0:52:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,荻妮 上来 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denise, get up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.60,0:53:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞 救我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.57,0:53:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.07,0:53:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.81,0:53:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab her!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.47,0:53:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卡住了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.71,0:53:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab her!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.18,0:53:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨蟒！在水里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The snake! It's in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.11,0:53:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.59,0:53:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garry!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.26,0:53:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞 抓住我手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary, give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.24,0:53:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garry!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.61,0:53:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖瑞！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garry!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.31,0:53:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！我要活捉它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no good to me dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.72,0:53:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.56,0:54:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿死者的灵魂蒙主恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the souls of the faithful depart through mercy of God…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.80,0:54:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,获得安息 阿门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}rest in peace. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.97,0:54:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯屈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Westridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.84,0:54:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真大胆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.34,0:54:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把蛇引来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you who brought that snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.78,0:54:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带来魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.78,0:54:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人内心都有魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a devil inside everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.85,0:54:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你别碰她 - 真可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get your hands off her. - Horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.32,0:55:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯屈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Westridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.16,0:55:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的装备拿到驾驶室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my gear up to the pilothouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.63,0:55:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你的佣人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your bloody poodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.57,0:55:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.70,0:55:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你命令我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you presume to order me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.27,0:55:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.57,0:55:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你扔进河里 怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you like I "presume" to throw you in the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.65,0:55:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到上面去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.45,0:55:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.62,0:55:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的人别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone else… don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.42,0:55:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.16,0:55:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.34,0:56:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴芮 我们要谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terri, let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.90,0:57:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.60,0:57:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想跟你谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.41,0:57:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想那神话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking about the myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.35,0:57:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是否知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.29,0:57:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这影片是我的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this film was supposed to be my big break.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.56,0:57:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,却变成了大灾难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's turned out to be a big disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.37,0:58:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想也许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.57,0:58:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以拍摄你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe I could film you…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.98,0:58:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,捕捉蛇 然后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}capturing the snake, and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.95,0:58:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次行程就不算白费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wouldn't all be for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.59,0:58:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不晓得 也许有危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.86,0:58:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.03,0:58:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但至少有你会保护我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at least you'd be there to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.54,0:58:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要保护？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.94,0:58:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.68,0:58:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已有很久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.55,0:58:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没和女人做爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}since I had a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.46,0:59:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我那么傻？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I'm stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.10,0:59:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不傻！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.04,0:59:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.78,0:59:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一击即中 要再打他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole in one. Shall I hit him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.35,0:59:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把他扔下河！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw him in the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.55,0:59:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 足够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't we had enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.35,0:59:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒想丢他下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ashamed to say I rather enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.62,0:59:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他捆起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just tie him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.39,1:00:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个设计好的圈套 对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was all one big setup?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.89,1:00:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,马泰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.16,1:00:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被困{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stranded.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.09,1:00:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那失事的船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shipwrecked boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.03,1:00:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你往医院的途径{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your route to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.77,1:00:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能忘记那只黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you forget about the wasp?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.18,1:00:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所做的并不难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you do is not so hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.18,1:00:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会捉蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can trap a snake too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.12,1:00:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你虽聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As smart as you are…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.12,1:00:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有我你活不成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't survive without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.57,1:00:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就到家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.62,1:01:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信你康复得这么快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe how good you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.99,1:01:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持下去 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang in there, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.13,1:01:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,驶船很难吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it hard to drive?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.87,1:01:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像开一辆凯迪拉克一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like driving a Cadillac Fleetwood.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.87,1:01:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 我要来教你怎么开动这个大家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what. I'll give you a driving lesson.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.81,1:01:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色拉杆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black knobs:
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.74,1:01:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,向上推向前走 向下是倒退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to go forward, down to go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.88,1:01:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色拉杆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red knobs:
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.87,1:01:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,向上快行 向下慢行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to go fast, down to go slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.68,1:01:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶盘 四次用力扭向左或右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wheel: Four turns hard over, left and right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.45,1:01:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇上麻烦 关掉发火装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get into trouble, turn off the ignition.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.16,1:01:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试试看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it for a spin.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.79,1:01:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.63,1:01:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我们回文明吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us back to civilization.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.96,1:01:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.46,1:01:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我们回去享受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us back to…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.03,1:01:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,洁净的床单及热水浴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}crisp sheets and hot showers.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.67,1:02:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看球赛决赛及喝啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The play-offs and a six-pack.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.87,1:02:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,打十八洞高球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighteen holes of golf and…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.84,1:02:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝琴酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a quadruple gin and tonic.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.64,1:02:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛市的塞车和我的行动电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}L.A. Traffic and my cellular phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.15,1:02:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't start.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.87,1:02:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,瀑布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.81,1:02:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真壮观 小丫头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a beautiful sight, baby bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.81,1:02:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说没有错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legend was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.01,1:02:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.89,1:02:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.52,1:02:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是美极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's absolutely beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.83,1:02:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.02,1:02:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们撞上河底了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we hit the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.73,1:03:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.97,1:03:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力向左转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the wheel hard to the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.29,1:03:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 用后档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Put it in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.14,1:03:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,关引擎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it down!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.55,1:03:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.56,1:03:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to winch ourself loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.83,1:03:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,且慢！你想干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.87,1:03:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要进到水中？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means getting in the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.80,1:03:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't got much choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.64,1:03:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将绳索缠好绑在那棵树上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lfigure me and you can go…and wrap a rope around that tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.17,1:03:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去把绳索绑在那棵树上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, wrap a rope around that tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.78,1:03:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要绑紧 否则我们就永远回不去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull it tight. If not, we stuck here forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.71,1:03:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快 绑完就回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to make it quick. In and out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.08,1:03:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做的事够多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rather hoped I'd done my bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.29,1:03:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的绳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our rope.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.92,1:04:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只够绕到树那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just enough to go around the tree. Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.33,1:04:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去这个 把它绑在树干上 确定要绑紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this. Get it around the trunk right there. Make sure it's secure.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.83,1:04:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.63,1:04:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这样 上次我像这样下到水里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate this. Last time I was in water like this…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.24,1:04:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,水蛭爬到我阴囊上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was up all night picking leeches off my scrotum.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.08,1:04:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要死前祈祷？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you going to pray?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.98,1:05:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别注视你要杀的猎物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never look in the eyes of those you kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.65,1:05:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将成为永远的梦魇 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will haunt you forever. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.07,1:05:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我立志宣誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lfirmly resolve…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.94,1:05:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,求神恩典{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with help and grace…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.69,1:05:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗清我罪行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to confess my sins, do penance…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.20,1:05:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我自新机会 阿门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to amend my life! Amen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.75,1:05:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神保佑…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanctus…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.15,1:05:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这小丫头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…baby bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.51,1:06:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.33,1:06:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,回船上！快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back on the boat! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.55,1:06:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.55,1:06:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.17,1:06:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.41,1:06:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,回船上！快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the boat! Go on! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.33,1:06:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.18,1:06:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.21,1:06:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 它就在你身后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, it's there!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.50,1:06:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,上船！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.48,1:06:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,大肥蛇！看这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, you fat-ass bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.49,1:06:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.37,1:06:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爬上岩石！- 快去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The rocks! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.52,1:07:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬上去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up the rocks!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.17,1:07:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.40,1:07:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！去拿枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! Get the gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.70,1:07:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.54,1:07:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿枪来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.92,1:07:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.26,1:07:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续爬！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.55,1:07:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 当心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.29,1:07:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny! Move your arm!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.28,1:08:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.15,1:08:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.22,1:08:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.89,1:08:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.29,1:08:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫斯屈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Westridge!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.24,1:08:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.93,1:09:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.20,1:09:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm caught.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.03,1:09:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！快来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.90,1:09:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.02,1:09:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼！不！给我你的手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, no! Give me your arm!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.56,1:09:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 撑着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.20,1:09:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到枪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.35,1:09:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.52,1:10:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.27,1:10:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我的巨蟒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my warrior snake!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.14,1:10:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.48,1:10:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻醉枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dart.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.65,1:10:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻醉剂生效了 上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tranquilizer's working. Get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.03,1:10:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！麻醉剂掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, the dart came out his back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.77,1:10:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 回床上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.57,1:11:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.02,1:11:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.19,1:11:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又昏迷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lost consciousness again.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.22,1:11:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着去开船 船脱离河床了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try to get us out of here. The tree knocked us loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.00,1:11:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴芮 你看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terri, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.50,1:11:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里可能有燃油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might have some fuel for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.60,1:11:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.21,1:12:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我扶吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need some help?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.36,1:12:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.20,1:12:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想知道曾发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even want to know what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.93,1:12:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.00,1:12:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他们这里有燃油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope they got some fuel though.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.76,1:13:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些桶子可能是燃油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those drums could be fuel.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.73,1:14:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇蜕的皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A snake skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.41,1:14:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有很多燃油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's plenty of fuel here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.31,1:14:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.79,1:15:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,该起床了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.34,1:15:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,猴血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.87,1:15:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要宰了你！萨朗！我发誓！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you, Sarone! I swear to God!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.21,1:15:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别惹我发火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.95,1:15:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See this?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.79,1:15:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,人骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human bones.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.76,1:15:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命的尽头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it comes out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.12,1:15:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,尘归尘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashes to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.74,1:16:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.51,1:16:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！你看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, look!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.15,1:16:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up, on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.08,1:16:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.81,1:16:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.51,1:17:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.13,1:18:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,松开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.10,1:18:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿了燃油就走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the fuel and get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.44,1:18:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管了 走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. Just go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.44,1:18:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 它追来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! It's coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.49,1:19:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 你在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.56,1:19:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是蛇窝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a nest.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.19,1:19:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让它追我上烟囱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have him chase me up the smokestack!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.50,1:19:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！我脚没受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I've got the legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.30,1:19:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们可以把它引进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, We can trap it there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.14,1:19:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.00,1:19:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.03,1:20:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能爬出去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you climb out the top?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.10,1:20:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以用这条绳子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can use the rope!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.20,1:20:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！我要炸飞了它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! I can blow him up!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.32,1:20:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我点火了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna light it!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.08,1:20:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,干吧！我上来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead! I'm at the top!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.20,1:20:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.29,1:20:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.41,1:20:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,点燃了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuse is lit!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.08,1:21:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.81,1:21:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,推边缘 用力！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the hinges!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.50,1:21:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！跳下来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! You got to jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.60,1:21:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 太高了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't! It's too high!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.84,1:21:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.32,1:22:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.19,1:22:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了它？是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we get him? Did we!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.70,1:22:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.40,1:22:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.71,1:22:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.64,1:22:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这就去拿燃油 然后就离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get the fuel, so we can get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.35,1:22:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.22,1:22:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.18,1:23:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.15,1:23:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.41,1:23:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,芙勒薇小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Flores…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.85,1:23:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真狼狈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.01,1:24:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到绷带了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.58,1:24:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看伤口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.95,1:24:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,西夏麻族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shirishama.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.25,1:24:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨朗说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarone was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.98,1:24:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.00,1:24:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.63,1:24:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿摄影机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the camera.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.19,1:24:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.44,1:24:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拍摄 - 开机了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roll film. - Camera rolling.
